---
import InfoPage from "../layouts/InfoPage.astro";
---
<InfoPage
  title="Contact the desk"
  eyebrow="Editorial · corrections · partnerships"
  lede="Reach Agewell Brief at hello@agewellbrief.com."
>
  <div class="contact-callout">
    <p class="eyebrow">Email</p>
    <a href="mailto:hello@agewellbrief.com">hello@agewellbrief.com</a>
  </div>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>Include the article URL, the passage at issue, and a source supporting the correction. Specific reports are easier to investigate quickly.</p>

  <h2>Sources and story ideas</h2>
  <p>Send the original study, announcement, dataset, or reporting link whenever possible. We prioritize material that readers can inspect for themselves.</p>

  <h2>Partnerships</h2>
  <p>Clearly identify sponsorship or distribution proposals in the subject line. Editorial coverage is not available for purchase.</p>
</InfoPage>
